    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "History",
            "paragraphs": [
                "From its origins as a traditional lending library to its current role at the heart of a shared education campus, Pimlico Library reflects the changing needs of the neighbourhood. Today, co-located with Pimlico Academy and Westminster Adult Education Service, it supports learning across generations, providing a welcoming space for reading, study, digital access and community activity. As Pimlico continues to evolve, the library remains a vital civic resource, connecting residents with knowledge, opportunity and each other."
            ]
        }
